BT /F1 56 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2751 Tm (The analysis, with every "why" open) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2878 Tm (Every figure carries its interval, the range the true value is likely to lie in, and the percentage it covers. When you) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2966 Tm (have excluded a shot, each figure is also given without the exclusion, so an exclusion is never hidden.) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3089 Tm (The zero correction says what to dial, in the scope's clicks when the rifle is chosen, when the group's centre is far) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3177 Tm (enough from the aim to be told from chance. When it is not, it says so and how many shots would settle it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3265 Tm (Dialling an offset nobody can distinguish from zero only chases noise.) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3388 Tm (The two cards:) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 395 3511 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 494 3511 Tm (Shape says whether the group is round, as far as its shots can tell. It also says whether it strings vertically,) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 494 3599 Tm (and what that test could have detected. A test on few shots misses most real stringing, so "no evidence" is) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 494 3687 Tm (not evidence of none.) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 395 3789 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 494 3789 Tm (Worst shot says whether the shot furthest out is further than groups of that size usually put their worst. Even) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 494 3877 Tm (when it is, that makes it worth a look, not a flyer. Whether it was called or pulled is yours to say.) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3979 Tm (What each "why" says, in plain words:) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 395 4102 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 494 4102 Tm (Zero correction: the smallest offset these shots can call; how the spread was estimated; and that moving a) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 494 4190 Tm (zero between distances needs the ballistics screen.) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 395 4292 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 494 4292 Tm (CEP: these circles come from the group's sigma, assuming the shots scatter evenly about the centre.) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 395 4394 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 494 4394 Tm (Shape: how often a truly round group would look this far from round, and the shape of the group's error) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 494 4482 Tm (ellipse.) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 395 4584 Tm (-) Tj ET
